InfraDashboard

This product is a re-creation of OpenSearch Dashboards (https://opensearch.org/), written to be
built from six npm packages: React, React DOM, Vega, Vega-Lite, Leaflet and markdown-it. It uses
no package of OpenSearch Dashboards, but it follows that product closely so that what was saved
with it keeps working, and parts of it are derived from it under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  - the mappings of the saved objects index (server/saved_objects_mappings.json),
  - the names, defaults and descriptions of the advanced settings (web/lib/settings_catalogue.json),
  - the rules by which a saved visualization is drawn: its axes, ticks, ranges, measures and the
    order in which the colours of the palette are given out,
  - the reading of a Vega spec (web/vis/vega): its settings, the requests it makes to OpenSearch,
    its warnings and its error texts,
  - the palette of chart colours, which is that of the OpenSearch UI framework,
  - the icons (web/components/icon.tsx, and the mark beside the help menu's link to GitHub in
    web/shell/help_menu.tsx): the drawings of the OpenSearch UI framework (OUI) 1.24.2, the
    component library OpenSearch Dashboards 3.9.0 is built with, copied as data from the icons
    it holds,
  - the sample data sets (server/sample_data/data_sets): their documents (the *.json.gz files,
    copied as they are from src/plugins/home/server/services/sample_data/data_sets of
    OpenSearch Dashboards 3.9.0), the field mappings of their indices, and their saved objects
    in the form OpenSearch Dashboards 3.9.0 writes them when it installs a set; and their
    preview pictures (web/static/plugins/home/assets/sample_data_resources, copied as they are
    from src/plugins/home/public/assets/sample_data_resources),
  - the pictures of the welcome screen of a new instance: its illustration
    (web/static/plugins/home/assets/common, copied as it is from
    src/plugins/home/public/assets/common) and the shapes behind it (web/static/core_app/images,
    copied as they are from src/core/public/core_app/images),
  - the picture of an empty VisBuilder canvas (web/static/plugins/visBuilder/assets, copied as
    it is from src/plugins/vis_builder/public/assets),
  - the tokens that mark the kind of a field (web/components/field_token.tsx): the glyphs and
    colours of the OpenSearch UI framework's tokens,
  - the pictures of the overview of a new instance
    (web/static/plugins/opensearchDashboardsOverview/assets, copied as they are from
    src/plugins/opensearch_dashboards_overview/public/assets),
  - the colours of the console and the reading of its requests
    (web/apps/dev_tools/console_highlight.ts and console_model.ts): the rules of the console's
    modes for the Ace editor (src/plugins/console/public/application/models/legacy_core_editor/mode
    and packages/osd-ace) and of the RowParser that reads the requests from them,
  - the way Markdown is read and drawn (web/lib/markdown.tsx): the settings of markdown-it and
    the rule for links that open a new tab of the Markdown component of opensearch_dashboards_react,
    with the getSecureRelForTarget and isDomainSecure functions of OUI 1.24.2 that rule uses,
  - the console's knowledge of the OpenSearch APIs (server/console_api_server.json): the answer
    OpenSearch Dashboards 3.9.0 gives at /api/console/api_server, copied as it is.

